{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0&gt;</strong> is a light rogue-like spell-building looter extraction game. Players must scavenge valuable items on the map while constructing their own spells to fend off waves of enemies, ultimately escaping with their hard-earned loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0In each session, players need to carefully manage their inventory, aiming to collect as many valuable items as possible and compete to see who can extract with the highest total value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Players can customize their spell effects based on different spells\u2014what exciting interactions might arise between them?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3317390?t=1743653975","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3317390?t=1743653975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317390/513b29ac412152685c2d17275749bfcf2103d23e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743653975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317390/513b29ac412152685c2d17275749bfcf2103d23e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743653975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0&gt;</strong> is a light rogue-like spell-building looter extraction game. Players must scavenge valuable items on the map while constructing their own spells to fend off waves of enemies, ultimately escaping with their hard-earned loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0In each session, players need to carefully manage their inventory, aiming to collect as many valuable items as possible and compete to see who can extract with the highest total value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Players can customize their spell effects based on different spells\u2014